{"title":"🎤 Toronto Karaoke Night – Every Friday at Ace of Spades Lounge 🎶","startsAt":"2026-10-30T20:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T01:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Looking for a fun Friday night in Toronto? Join us **every Friday at 8:00 PM** for an unforgettable **Karaoke Night** at **Ace of Spades Lounge**!\nWhether you're a seasoned performer or just want to cheer on your friends, everyone is welcome. Grab the mic, sing your favorite songs, meet new people, and enjoy a night full of great energy.\n\n### What to Expect\n\n🎤 Karaoke all night long\n🍔 Delicious food and late-night bites\n🍹 Great drinks from our full bar\n🤝 Meet new people and socialize\n🎶 Fun music and an exciting atmosphere\n✨ Good vibes and unforgettable memories\nCome solo, bring a date, or gather your friends—this is one of the best ways to kick off your weekend in Toronto.\n\n**📅 Every Friday**\n**🕗 Starts at 8:00 PM**\n**📍 Ace of Spades Lounge**\n536 Manning Avenue\nToronto, ON\n\n**🎙️ Grab the mic. Be the star.**\n**Come socialize, sing, eat, drink, and have fun—we'll see you every Friday!**","venue":{"name":"Ace of Spades","address":"536 Manning Ave., Toronto","lat":43.660393,"lng":-79.41476,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Do Stuff and Make Friends in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/7/c/7/highres_535146087.jpeg"}